{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02612","headline":"古意六首 六 · 王绩","name":"古意六首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩凤欲将归，提罗出郊访。\n罗张大泽已，凤入重云扬。\n朝栖崑阆木，夕饮蓬壶涨。\n问凤那远飞，贤君坐相望。\n凤言荷深德，微禽安足尚。\n但使雏卵全，无令[矰]缴放。\n皇臣力牧举，帝乐箫韶畅。\n自有来巢时，明年阿阁上。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}